  {
    "title": "How to improve your child education.",
    "link": "https://test7334.substack.com/p/sdfsdfsdf",
    "pubDate": "2026-08-24",
    "description": "Expert guidance for students, from choosing the right course and university to planning your future.",
    "thumbnail": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CHAL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ab0ec14-a0b0-4a16-a917-0bff825b8757_4016x2677.jpeg",
    "content": "<p>Confused about what to study, where to study, or how to plan your academic journey?</p><p>We’re here to help. 🎓</p><p>Our education consultancy provides personalized guidance to students at every step — from course selection and university applications to career-focused education planning.</p><p><strong>What we help with:</strong></p><ul><li><p>🎯 Course &amp; career guidance</p></li><li><p>🏫 University &amp; college selection</p></li><li><p>📚 Admission &amp; application support</p></li><li><p>🌍 Study-abroad guidance</p></li><li><p>📝 Application &amp; documentation assistance</p></li><li><p>🚀 Future-focused academic planning</p></li></ul><p>Your goals are unique. Your education plan should be too.</p><p><strong>Let’s build the right path for your future.</strong></p><p>📩 Get in touch with us today</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CHAL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ab0ec14-a0b0-4a16-a917-0bff825b8757_4016x2677.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CHAL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ab0ec14-a0b0-4a16-a917-0bff825b8757_4016x2677.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CHAL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ab0ec14-a0b0-4a16-a917-0bff825b8757_4016x2677.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CHAL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ab0ec14-a0b0-4a16-a917-0bff825b8757_4016x2677.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_